# A behaviour kept by one game and forgotten by the next
# (fixtures/wmemo). Shift+C at the main menu plays the credits, whose
# script gives Twinsen the normal behaviour, which keeps the one he had,
# and ends without giving it back. Then a save by the prison is
# loaded, Twinsen walks into the prison's back door's zone, F2 makes him
# sporty and W opens the door: he comes into the prison sporty, as in
# wmemo, and Space makes him jump.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
down Shift_L
key c
up Shift_L
sleep 230
shot menu2
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 12
shot start
down Up
sleep 0.8
up Up
sleep 1
key F2
sleep 2
key w
sleep 10
shot inside
key space
sleep 0.5
shot jump
sleep 3
shot end
